OL,3,GNEWSAPlant makes 5.5m extra litres of
OL,4,Adrinking water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA utility firm has begun using its
OL,7,Fdesalination plant to convert seawater
OL,8,Finto freshwater to top up reservoir
OL,9,Flevels amid the ongoing drought and
OL,10,Fhigh temperatures.
OL,12,FJersey Water announced plans earlier
OL,13,Fthis month to use the plant in La
OL,14,FRosiere, Corbiere, which it said was
OL,15,Fpredominately used as a "back up" when
OL,16,Fit became concerned about reservoir
OL,17,Flevels.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
