OL,3,GNEWSAPlant makes 5.5m extra litres of
OL,4,Adrinking water
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe island's reservoirs can hold a
OL,7,Fmaximum supply of water to last 120
OL,8,Fdays but levels have declined over the
OL,9,Fsummer, with temperatures rising as
OL,10,Fhigh as 39.3B0C (102.7F), and a drought
OL,11,Flater confirmed.
OL,13,FMark Manton, Jersey Water's chief
OL,14,Foperations officer said the plant added
OL,15,Fabout 5.5 million litres of additional
OL,16,Fwater per day.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
